From: NayiemW <37852059+NayiemW@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 02:21:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Reject a block when the round has no delegate at its slot

BlockProcessor.validateGenerator now rejects a block when the round's
delegate list has no delegate at the block's slot index. It logs a
warning and returns false. Solar logged at debug level and fell through
to accept the block, so the generator check failed open.

Test: patches/tests/41-generator-check-fail-closed.test.js (stubs). A
10-entry list with slot index 20 now gives false (base: true). A
53-entry list gives true for the scheduled delegate and false for any
other, as before.

Patch: 41
Consensus: yes
---
